          "id": 2314425597,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I recreated the OS400 SNMP behavior (I don't have OS400 at home, so it's all manual work to achieve https://www.ibm.com/support/pages/apar/IZ82383 ) and unfortunately it gets broken with this MR. With MR applied, the _packet list_ doesn't behave correctly, and so the _conversations dialog_. I will give some more time to the SNMP dissector to see what the options are.\n\n[merged_snmp_udp_os400.pcapng](/uploads/08b9142b693b8951374e823529bc3cad/merged_snmp_udp_os400.pcapng)\n\n![11150_os400](/uploads/74121c582e4d84e511e117727a8b7d7c/11150_os400.JPG)",
