        {
          "id": 2479892811,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "OK OK, my test above is obviously on an UDP protocol (SNMP) and not covered by this MR, but when testing it it lead me to another behavior (now fixed and committed).\n\nThis suggested MR looks good, and I now tested on the _Ultimate pcap_ with no side effects. However as the conversation code also changed by integrating further the _deinterlacing strategy_, the very same fix could (should) be applied to the `find_conversation_deinterlaced()` function.\n\nA minor correction likely to add I think, \n`if (ctype != CONVERSATION_IBQP && !(options & NO_ADDR_B))`\nshould also exclude the UDP protocol as in the previous tests.\n\nResolving this thread.",
          "author": {
